# heavy hero source — only the compressed hero.mp4/.webm are deployed
docs/media/*.mov

# git worktree mounts for hive worker agents — never commit (each is a separate branch checkout)
.worktrees/

# raw demo screen recordings — only the compressed docs/media/demo/*.mp4 are deployed
docs/media/MunderDifflin*.mp4

# blog theme previews (local only)
docs/blog-preview-*/

# Live hive runtime data — per-agent memory, inbox/outbox, event log, task
# registry, MemPalace semantic-memory store, roster + its rolling backups.
# This is the user's own personal session/work history (agent conversations,
# task content, timestamps), not source — it was previously tracked (a
# pre-existing issue, not introduced here) and was about to grow by dozens of
# roster-backups/*.json files per session. Untracked going forward; existing
# committed copies remain in history until a deliberate history rewrite.
hive/
roster.json
roster-backups/
palace/
hallways.json
